{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Calm the storm and repair your skin barrier. Turmeric Swirl features a potent anti-inflammatory ribbon of Turmeric, healing Sea Buckthorn, and antibacterial Tea Tree. Together, they rapidly cool angry redness, soothe unexpected breakouts, and feed your skin the essential vitamins it needs to heal itself.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>Turmeric Swirl is a dedicated, anti-inflammatory powerhouse formulated to soothe highly reactive, inflamed, or angry skin types. It ribbons active Turmeric with the protective, vitamin-dense oils of Sea Buckthorn berries and a cleansing touch of pure Tea Tree.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Rapid Redness Reduction: Strongly targets inflammation pathing to rapidly cool angry, burning, or eczema-prone skin surface areas</li>
                    <li>Tissue Recovery: Sea Buckthorn delivers rare Omega-7 fatty acids, which actively regenerate and heal damaged or broken skin structures</li>
                    <li>Gentle Blemish Suppression: Low-dose Tea Tree maintains clear skin by safely sanitizing pores without aggravating active sensitivity</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Inflamed, irritated, or highly sensitive skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Coconut Milk, Turmeric root powder, Organic Turmeric Oil, Organic Olive Oil, Shea Butter, Kaolin Clay, Orange Oil, Organic Lavender Oil, Lemon Oil, Sea Buckthorn Oil, and Tea Tree Oil.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Work into a gentle lather and glide over sensitive areas without scrubbing.</p></div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-care' %}
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Storage / Safety Disclaimer<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <p><strong>Safety Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of children.</p>
    <p><strong>Aromatherapy &amp; Herbal Note:</strong> This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-shipping' %}
{%- endif -%}
